  '9af774f9-eb82-e36a-f3a1-68c76c9e3f2a', 'template', 'free', 'published', 'Problem Definition Worksheet', 'problem-definition-worksheet', 'A structured worksheet for writing a problem statement that''s specific enough to test, instead of a hunch.', 'Deliberately solution-free. This worksheet asks you to name the audience, the frequency of the problem, the current cost of it going unsolved, and the evidence you already have (versus what you''re assuming). Teams that skip this step tend to build solutions to problems nobody can actually describe.',
  'A one-paragraph problem statement with a named audience, a frequency, and a cost of the problem going unsolved.', 'Anyone starting from ''people struggle with X'' who needs to make that concrete.', 'Use before you''ve decided on a solution — this worksheet is deliberately solution-free.', 'Not useful once you''ve already committed to a specific product direction; use the Product Specification instead.',
  20, 30, 'beginner', '1.0',
  null, null, 'GBP', '488fbee7-849e-4e17-2d2e-e386ec5328ca', false,
  '2026-06-05T09:00:00Z', null, 'Problem Definition Worksheet — free template', 'Write a problem statement specific enough to test, free, in about 20 minutes.', '{"placeholder":true}'::jsonb,
  null, null
)
