  'bde66657-b6ae-eecf-b995-64f809042223', 'template', 'free', 'scheduled', 'Existing Alternatives Review', 'existing-alternatives-review', 'A side-by-side review of how people currently solve the problem — including doing nothing — so you know what you''re really competing with.', 'Founders who say ''we have no competitors'' usually mean ''no other venture-backed startup does exactly this.'' This worksheet widens the lens: spreadsheets, manual workarounds, competitors'' adjacent products, and doing nothing are all alternatives your idea has to beat. You''ll come away with a comparison table and a clearer view of the switching cost customers actually face.',
  'A comparison table of 4–6 alternatives with their strengths, weaknesses and the switching cost people face.', 'Founders who assume ''no direct competitors'' means ''no alternatives''.', 'Use once you''ve defined the problem, before designing a solution.', 'Not a substitute for direct customer conversations about why they haven''t switched already.',
  30, 45, 'beginner', '1.0',
  null, null, 'GBP', '488fbee7-849e-4e17-2d2e-e386ec5328ca', false,
  null, '2026-08-18T09:00:00Z', 'Existing Alternatives Review — free template', 'Review the real alternatives to your idea, including doing nothing, free.', '{"placeholder":true}'::jsonb,
