  'aae370e5-ad0b-92f7-b547-094452885b28', 'template', 'free', 'published', 'MVP Scope in One Page', 'mvp-scope-in-one-page', 'Force your MVP onto a single page: what''s in, what''s explicitly out, and the one question it needs to answer.', 'A short, deliberately restrictive scoping template for a first release. Naming what''s explicitly out is as important as naming what''s in — this is the page you hold up when someone suggests ''just one more feature'' before launch.',
