  'dcf1f382-9957-c65e-c3fc-84fbe30d3c02', 'tool', 'free', 'published', 'Product Idea Assessor', 'product-idea-assessor-tool', 'Answer a few questions about your idea and get a scored evidence-quality readiness verdict — proceed, gather more evidence, or pause.', 'The interactive version of the Copy–Improve–Differentiate Assessment. Classify your idea, answer four evidence questions, and get a deterministic score, a named strongest and weakest area, and one concrete next evidence action — usable anonymously, with no account required.',
