  'd80b3dd7-cf23-f19e-d8f4-9ce178bb7827', 'guide', 'free', 'published', 'Product Prioritisation Tool: the Guide', 'product-prioritisation-tool', 'Four scheduling strategies for ordering a task list, and how to pick the one that fits.', 'Explains four scheduling strategies — Earliest Due Date, Moore''s Algorithm, Shortest Processing Time, Weighted Processing Time — plus the Eisenhower importance/urgency matrix as a sense-check. Read this before the Template or the Tool — both assume the technique this guide teaches.',
  'A clear framework for deciding which scheduling strategy fits your task list right now.', 'Founders and small teams with more tasks than time who want a deliberate way to decide what to work on next.', 'Read this first, before the Template or the Tool.', 'Skip straight to the Tool if you already know your answers and just want a scored recommendation.',
