  '7ac12b65-9f01-d7fe-3776-e1e67c0eb0cb', 'bundle', 'paid', 'published', 'Product Definition Pack', 'product-definition-pack', 'Nine templates that take a validated idea to a written product specification ready for design or build.', 'The Product Definition Pack sequences nine templates — vision, target user, user needs and scenarios, product principles, feature evaluation, MVP scope, a full product specification, acceptance criteria, and a launch readiness review — into one connected process for turning a validated idea into a specification you can actually hand to a builder.',
  'A complete, reviewable product definition: vision, users, scope and acceptance criteria in one connected set.', 'Founders and product managers defining a product after idea validation, before development starts.', 'Use once you have evidence an idea is worth pursuing and need to define exactly what to build.', 'If you haven''t validated the idea yet, start with the Idea Validation Pack first.',
